          "title": "Reopening P082 work: T339 shipped `LayerContent` with the wrong arm shape (`View { node, realized }` instead of the ratified `View(ViewNode)`). Antonio chose option 1 on 2026-08-04 — match the spec and hold the realized tree beside the content on `DynamicLayer`. Doing that correction under this phase before T327's own work begins.",
          "description": "Reopening P082 work: T339 shipped `LayerContent` with the wrong arm shape (`View { node, realized }` instead of the ratified `View(ViewNode)`). Antonio chose option 1 on 2026-08-04 — match the spec and hold the realized tree beside the content on `DynamicLayer`. Doing that correction under this phase before T327's own work begins."
        }
